  "title": "U Mass UMass Memorial Health Receives two hundred fifty thousand dollars $250,000 Grant from Bank of America to Support the North Pavilion",
  "summary": "UMass Memorial Health today announced it has received a $250,000 Anchor Grant from Bank of America. This significant funding will advance expansion of the state-of-the art North Pavilion, part of UMass Memorial Medical Center. This marks the first corporate gift toward the North Pavilion philanthropic campaign.",
